  T^{pq}.$ The product construction motivates the rule, but the transformation law is the definition of a tensor. A rank-three contravariant tensor would acquire three such Jacobian factors.

en:
Each upper index contributes one forward Jacobian: $(T')^{mn}
 =\frac{\partial y^m}{\partial x^p}
  \frac{\partial y^n}{\partial x^q}
  T^{pq}.$ The product construction motivates the rule, but the transformation law is the definition of a tensor. A rank-three contravariant tensor would acquire three such Jacobian factors.

ja:
各上付き添字は一つの順ヤコビアンに寄与する： $(T')^{mn}
 =\frac{\partial y^m}{\partial x^p}
  \frac{\partial y^n}{\partial x^q}
  T^{pq}.$ 積の構成はこの規則を動機づけるが、変換則がテンソルの定義である。三階の反変テンソルはそのようなヤコビアン因子を三つ獲得するであろう。

zh:
每个上指标贡献一个正向雅可比因子： $(T')^{mn}
 =\frac{\partial y^m}{\partial x^p}
  \frac{\partial y^n}{\partial x^q}
  T^{pq}.$ 乘积构造给出了这条规则的动机，但变换律才是张量的定义。一个三阶逆变张量将获得三个这样的雅可比因子。

p.src:
Likewise, each lower index contributes an inverse Jacobian: $T'_{mn}
 =\frac{\partial x^p}{\partial y^m}
  \frac{\partial x^q}{\partial y^n}
  T_{pq}.$ A mixed tensor uses one factor of each kind.

